WEBVTT

00:08.870 --> 00:11.970
Not being able to use my right hand
is really inconvenient.

00:17.940 --> 00:18.740
Here.

00:19.580 --> 00:20.820
Say "ah."

00:20.820 --> 00:21.980
Ahh!

00:22.430 --> 00:24.120
Thanks!

00:26.090 --> 00:28.720
But I'm fine. I can do it myself.

00:28.720 --> 00:30.630
I-I see.

00:31.340 --> 00:32.720
<i>What are they, married?</i>

00:34.350 --> 00:36.350
Let's go!

00:36.350 --> 00:37.950
T-Takada-kun!

00:39.600 --> 00:42.640
Didn't they say you can't play soccer yet?

00:44.080 --> 00:45.700
You got me there.

00:46.450 --> 00:49.120
You're going to make your mom worry.

00:49.120 --> 00:51.110
S-Sorry, Nishimura-san!

00:51.110 --> 00:52.820
Please don't tell my mom!

00:55.390 --> 00:56.610
<i>They're so married.</i>

00:59.610 --> 01:03.530
Takada, I made a copy of my notes for you.

01:03.530 --> 01:06.200
Really? You're a lifesaver!

01:06.200 --> 01:08.860
Just ask me if you need anything!

01:08.860 --> 01:10.530
Thanks, Hino-kun.

01:11.350 --> 01:12.830
<i>So </i>not<i> married.</i>

01:19.140 --> 01:21.900
Thanks for always worrying about me.

01:21.900 --> 01:22.340
Huh?

01:22.700 --> 01:27.340
Once I get better, it'll 
be my turn to protect you!

01:28.220 --> 01:30.090
Y-You don't have to do that.

01:30.750 --> 01:32.870
You do plenty already.

01:34.240 --> 01:36.360
Why is your face red?

01:35.010 --> 01:36.340
Tank tops...

01:38.470 --> 01:41.260
<i>The best married couple!</i>

03:08.040 --> 03:11.960
My <b>Clueless</b> First Friend

03:12.830 --> 03:17.800
<i>Episode 9 "Run! Shout! Field Day"</i>

03:20.770 --> 03:22.350
<i>Field day...</i>

03:23.060 --> 03:26.770
<i>Takada-kun said he'd do his 
best to stick with me.</i>

03:43.200 --> 03:47.200
<i>But even if Takada-kun
can't take part in the race,</i>

03:47.930 --> 03:50.600
<i>I don't want it to be like 
the other field days</i>

03:51.120 --> 03:53.460
<i>where I just watched from the sidelines.</i>

03:55.320 --> 03:58.710
<i>It would be unfair if I didn't try my best.</i>

04:04.100 --> 04:07.330
I don't wanna practice for field day.

04:07.330 --> 04:08.290
Right?

04:08.290 --> 04:12.640
We're in fifth grade now.
Trying so hard is childish.

04:12.880 --> 04:17.170
Kasahara-san, you ran a lot back 
in earlier grades, didn't you?

04:17.170 --> 04:18.610
Hey, that's right.

04:18.610 --> 04:19.910
Yeah...

04:21.240 --> 04:23.230
That takes me back!

04:24.190 --> 04:26.940
Takada, is it a "cast" or "plaster" for you?

04:24.580 --> 04:30.510
For the team relay race, we were going 
to have Takada run for the boys.

04:26.940 --> 04:28.480
Cast, I guess?

04:28.480 --> 04:31.290
It's tank tops for me.

04:30.510 --> 04:32.740
But that might not be possible.

04:31.290 --> 04:32.740
Wait, what?

04:32.740 --> 04:37.420
Do we have any other boys 
who could run in the relay?

04:41.800 --> 04:43.480
How about it, Kitagawa?

04:43.480 --> 04:44.670
Huh, me?!

04:44.670 --> 04:46.440
Well, I...

04:46.880 --> 04:49.760
can't really run in front of a big crowd.

04:49.760 --> 04:52.030
You <i>do</i> get surprisingly nervous.

04:52.030 --> 04:53.140
Shut up!

04:53.340 --> 04:55.080
I'm sure you'll do great!

04:55.080 --> 04:57.470
You're also plenty fast!

04:57.470 --> 04:59.730
H-Hino runs fast too!

04:59.960 --> 05:03.370
I'm devoting myself to the
giant ball rolling event.

05:03.370 --> 05:04.990
So freakin' what?!

05:04.990 --> 05:05.980
Just run already!

05:05.980 --> 05:09.350
I know we'll be in good hands
if you're our runner!

05:09.350 --> 05:10.950
Let's make sure to win!

05:13.200 --> 05:15.640
I can just see our victory now!

05:15.640 --> 05:16.760
Whoo!

05:18.470 --> 05:20.040
All right already!

05:20.040 --> 05:21.930
All I gotta do is run, right?!

05:21.930 --> 05:25.640
If you insist so badly, 
you leave me no choice!

05:25.640 --> 05:28.090
Yay! Let's win!

05:29.320 --> 05:31.530
Looks like the boys will be fine.

05:31.530 --> 05:32.510
All that's left is...

05:32.900 --> 05:34.810
Excuse me, Sensei!

05:34.810 --> 05:37.900
I don't want to run!

05:37.900 --> 05:39.020
Me too.

05:39.020 --> 05:40.040
Me three.

05:40.040 --> 05:41.660
Me four!

05:42.710 --> 05:45.710
Isn't there anyone who wants to run?

05:45.710 --> 05:49.800
Who wants to embarrass themselves 
in front of the whole school?

05:49.800 --> 05:51.080
That's right!

05:51.080 --> 05:54.650
I'd rather be cheering on the sixth graders.

05:56.260 --> 05:58.160
What do we do now?

06:02.040 --> 06:04.560
<i>I should run.</i>

06:08.370 --> 06:09.770
<i>That's right.</i>

06:09.770 --> 06:11.810
<i>I don't want to just watch.</i>

06:12.210 --> 06:15.050
<i>I want to do my best alongside Takada-kun.</i>

06:18.920 --> 06:19.970
<i>So...</i>

06:21.610 --> 06:22.960
<i>I want to run.</i>

06:23.860 --> 06:25.060
<i>But...</i>

06:40.220 --> 06:41.470
Akane-chan?

06:41.470 --> 06:43.570
What's the matter? Are you all right?

06:43.570 --> 06:45.950
Yeah. It's nothing.

06:49.120 --> 06:50.670
Really, it's nothing.

06:51.890 --> 06:58.390
Teachers' Lounge

06:52.310 --> 06:55.430
Sensei, I'm leaving the log on your desk.

06:58.320 --> 06:59.770
Bye for now.

07:06.120 --> 07:09.840
Having to take gym clothes home
is kind of a pain.

07:14.400 --> 07:15.710
Um...

07:18.210 --> 07:19.820
Kasahara-san.

07:22.720 --> 07:24.510
You gave me a real scare!

07:24.510 --> 07:26.940
Don't hide like that! You're so spooky!

07:26.940 --> 07:28.590
S-Sorry.

07:28.590 --> 07:31.330
I wasn't trying to hide or anything.

07:31.330 --> 07:33.050
What do you want?

07:33.050 --> 07:35.210
I handed in the logbook for today.

07:35.480 --> 07:37.850
Oh, yeah, thanks.

07:37.850 --> 07:41.220
But... it's not about that.

07:41.880 --> 07:44.630
I wanted to ask you a favor, Kasahara-san.

07:44.630 --> 07:45.610
What?

07:45.980 --> 07:48.290
<i>You</i> want a favor from <i>me</i>?

07:48.290 --> 07:49.740
Yes, please.

07:52.250 --> 07:56.240
I want you to run in the field day relay!

07:56.510 --> 07:57.690
What?

07:58.680 --> 08:00.490
Umi-chan told me.

08:00.490 --> 08:03.160
Kasahara-san, you run really fast.

08:03.160 --> 08:06.000
You were the top runner in third grade.

08:06.330 --> 08:09.000
H-H-Hold on a minute!

08:09.000 --> 08:10.860
There's no way I'm doing it!

08:10.860 --> 08:14.320
Trying so hard on field day
in the fifth grade...

08:14.890 --> 08:16.510
I-It's so dorky!

08:16.710 --> 08:18.810
I-It's not dorky at all!

08:18.810 --> 08:20.380
It so is!

08:20.380 --> 08:24.510
Wait, if you care that much, 
then why don't <i>you</i> run?

08:24.510 --> 08:26.090
I want to run!

08:26.480 --> 08:30.280
I do... but I can't.

08:31.520 --> 08:35.720
I tried my hardest, but no 
matter how much I practice...

08:35.720 --> 08:38.930
I'm just a slow runner.

08:43.410 --> 08:47.130
If I run, we won't have 
any chance of winning.

08:48.340 --> 08:50.540
So please...

08:53.150 --> 08:56.420
If you try your hardest 
and can't win, then so be it.

08:56.860 --> 08:59.050
You're saying that's not good enough?

09:00.700 --> 09:01.630
Yeah.

09:02.580 --> 09:05.840
Are you trying to get me 
to run for Takada-kun's sake?

09:05.840 --> 09:06.530
Huh?

09:09.610 --> 09:10.810
Answer me.

09:13.400 --> 09:17.010
I'm having fun at school now.

09:17.390 --> 09:21.320
I want to do something instead 
of just watching on.

09:21.670 --> 09:24.920
That all started with Takada-kun,

09:25.330 --> 09:28.490
but I'm the one who wants us to do our best.

09:31.150 --> 09:32.370
Please.

09:34.600 --> 09:35.830
Sheesh.

09:35.830 --> 09:38.570
Stubborn <i>and</i> gloomy? What a combo.

09:40.400 --> 09:46.270
If Takada-kun ends up running, 
<i>I'll</i> be the one passing the baton to him.

09:47.310 --> 09:48.360
You're okay with that?

09:48.640 --> 09:53.030
It could heat things up
between the two of us.

09:53.370 --> 09:55.370
And you're really okay with that?

09:55.370 --> 09:58.000
Yeah! That's more than fine by me!

09:59.600 --> 10:01.110
Seriously?

10:01.320 --> 10:02.620
Thank you!

10:02.620 --> 10:04.980
Thank you, Kasahara-san!

10:04.980 --> 10:08.890
Jeez, c'mon! You're too close!
It's embarrassing!

10:10.530 --> 10:12.390
This is a one-time deal, okay?!

10:12.390 --> 10:13.200
Yeah!

10:21.970 --> 10:23.590
Amazing!

10:23.590 --> 10:24.830
So fast!

10:24.830 --> 10:25.880
She's back!

10:29.090 --> 10:31.610
Kasahara the Swift is back!

10:31.610 --> 10:32.650
Shut your traps!

10:32.650 --> 10:34.350
Stop calling me that!

10:34.350 --> 10:37.080
"The Swift"? That's so cool!

10:35.940 --> 10:37.730
You go, girl!

10:37.730 --> 10:39.470
That's Kasahara-san's old nickname

10:39.470 --> 10:42.920
because she was so fast and peerless.

10:42.920 --> 10:44.360
I see.

10:44.360 --> 10:48.180
All right! Looks like we've
got this year's relay in the bag.

10:48.640 --> 10:52.090
D-Do I really have to run?

10:52.090 --> 10:54.090
Heck yeah!

10:52.490 --> 10:54.090
Let's win this!

11:00.950 --> 11:02.730
<i>Then finally...</i>

11:03.510 --> 11:07.010
<i>Field day arrived.</i>

11:06.430 --> 11:08.930
<b>Field Day</b>

11:08.930 --> 11:13.940
My <b>Clueless</b> First Friend

11:08.930 --> 11:13.940
<i><b>Kasahara the Swift</b></i>

11:29.760 --> 11:40.130
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

11:41.600 --> 11:44.970
Takada-kun is going to the 
hospital this morning

11:44.970 --> 11:48.470
and asking the doctor if he can run today.

11:49.870 --> 11:52.660
I wonder if he'll be back
in time for the relay...

11:53.240 --> 11:58.730
We just need to do what we can
so he's not disappointment when he gets here!

11:58.730 --> 12:00.990
Yeah, you're right.

12:00.990 --> 12:01.870
Okay!

12:08.420 --> 12:10.070
Nishimura! Adachi!

12:10.070 --> 12:11.940
You two gather the balls!

12:11.940 --> 12:13.910
I can do all the throwing!

12:13.910 --> 12:14.980
Okay!

12:15.370 --> 12:16.210
There!

12:16.210 --> 12:17.330
Hi-yah!

12:21.260 --> 12:23.370
I-I've collected them!

12:23.370 --> 12:25.250
All right! Good job!

12:25.250 --> 12:26.520
Leave the rest to me!

12:26.680 --> 12:28.540
Go, go, go!

12:29.240 --> 12:33.470
<i>Kitagawa-kun just said I did a good job...</i>

12:33.800 --> 12:35.800
<i>Field day is amazing!</i>

12:38.670 --> 12:41.980
I put in extra effort for today!

12:42.360 --> 12:44.330
Thanks, Dad.

12:44.330 --> 12:47.060
But I can't finish all of this.

12:47.060 --> 12:49.340
Oh, you've got more marinated eggs!

12:49.340 --> 12:51.990
Let's trade again, Akane-chan!

12:51.990 --> 12:54.120
Sure. I've got more than eggs, too.

12:54.440 --> 12:55.590
Are you sure?

12:54.640 --> 12:55.590
I've got these.

12:55.590 --> 12:56.300
Yeah!

12:56.820 --> 12:57.830
Thanks!

13:01.300 --> 13:07.680
<b>Tea{large text}</b>

13:01.300 --> 13:07.680
<b>Tea{large text}</b>

13:01.300 --> 13:07.680
Don't forget to stay hydrated!!

13:04.750 --> 13:06.300
I want some tea.

13:07.680 --> 13:09.330
<b>Water</b>

13:07.680 --> 13:09.330
<b>Tea</b>

13:09.330 --> 13:13.100
<b>Please help yourselves</b>

13:09.330 --> 13:13.100
<b>Don't forget to stay hydrated!!</b>

13:14.640 --> 13:16.480
What's wrong, Kitagawa?

13:16.480 --> 13:18.840
You were full of energy just a minute ago.

13:18.840 --> 13:20.970
Sh-Shut it.

13:20.970 --> 13:23.120
Ah, is it the relay this afternoon?

13:23.470 --> 13:24.960
Got those nerves, huh?

13:24.960 --> 13:26.760
Shut up already!

13:29.940 --> 13:32.130
Wha... Yukiko-san?

13:32.130 --> 13:34.080
Why are you recording this?

13:34.080 --> 13:36.680
You see, it's all for Taiyou.

13:36.680 --> 13:38.910
I'm sure he's dying to see it.

13:39.270 --> 13:43.550
I'm sure he'll be thrilled
if I get lots of footage of you.

13:43.550 --> 13:45.240
Wh-What?!

13:46.400 --> 13:49.730
Taiyou-kun's just a friend, right, Akane?

13:49.730 --> 13:51.720
Y-Yes, he is...

13:53.850 --> 13:57.000
So, um, where is Takada-kun?

13:57.000 --> 14:00.830
Oh, he must be getting 
examined right about now.

14:00.830 --> 14:03.310
Looks like it'll run into the afternoon.

14:03.620 --> 14:05.650
But he said he'll be here for sure!

14:05.650 --> 14:07.670
Since Nishimura-san is waiting!

14:09.000 --> 14:12.520
Er, I meant since Nishimura-san 
and her friends.

14:12.520 --> 14:13.550
My bad!

14:13.550 --> 14:14.880
R-Right...

14:19.950 --> 14:21.230
<i>Takada-kun...</i>

14:21.620 --> 14:23.570
<i>I hope he makes it in time.</i>

14:24.900 --> 14:28.790
<i>I'll give it my all even if 
Takada-kun isn't here.</i>

14:30.520 --> 14:33.890
<i>But if possible, I want to be with him.</i>

14:34.570 --> 14:39.010
One, two! One, two!

14:34.570 --> 14:39.010
<i>I want to do my best alongside Takada-kun!</i>

14:39.010 --> 14:40.260
What?!

14:40.260 --> 14:42.380
I'm the anchor?!

14:42.380 --> 14:47.020
Well, we decided on the order 
when we thought Takada would be running.

14:47.240 --> 14:49.540
You didn't pick a sixth grader?!

14:49.540 --> 14:51.520
Just how fast is he?!

14:51.520 --> 14:57.040
Not a lot of grade schoolers can 
get a 7.3 time in the 50-meter!

14:57.040 --> 15:00.470
Well, either way, 
it's in your hands, Kitagawa.

15:00.470 --> 15:01.360
Ah...

15:03.120 --> 15:07.660
Seriously, what's taking you so long, Takada?!

15:06.090 --> 15:12.050
<b>School Field Day</b>

15:08.020 --> 15:11.290
What a wimp. Just accept it already.

15:11.290 --> 15:12.060
Huh?!

15:12.260 --> 15:14.060
And what's gotten into <i>you</i>,

15:14.060 --> 15:15.910
suddenly getting all fired up?

15:15.910 --> 15:17.440
That's not your style!

15:17.440 --> 15:19.100
Put a sock in it.

15:19.900 --> 15:22.630
It's none of your business.

15:23.430 --> 15:26.710
If I go easy, I'd feel like I lost to her.

15:27.080 --> 15:27.890
Huh?

15:29.790 --> 15:32.440
I want to win just as badly.

15:32.850 --> 15:36.780
<i>Our final event will be the team relay race.</i>

15:36.780 --> 15:41.380
<i>All participants, please assemble 
in the center of the track.</i>

15:38.790 --> 15:41.370
<b>Entrance Gate</b>

15:41.380 --> 15:43.030
Y-Yukiko-san!

15:43.030 --> 15:43.870
Where's Takada-kun?

15:43.870 --> 15:47.120
No dice... Mom's not picking up.

15:47.120 --> 15:48.700
Is she in the middle of driving?

15:49.070 --> 15:51.990
If that's the case, he should be here soon.

15:53.070 --> 15:54.930
On your marks!

15:55.600 --> 15:57.160
Get set!

15:58.860 --> 16:01.530
<i>The first runners have all taken off!</i>

16:01.530 --> 16:04.030
I-It's started...

16:06.390 --> 16:08.340
We'll leave them all in the dust.

16:09.020 --> 16:13.160
But I really wanted to pass
the baton to Takada-kun...

16:13.500 --> 16:15.520
He was supposed to be our anchor.

16:15.880 --> 16:17.160
Our anchor?!

16:17.580 --> 16:18.610
What?!

16:23.540 --> 16:26.440
What's wrong with Kitagawa-kun?

16:26.440 --> 16:30.220
He definitely drank too much tea.

16:30.220 --> 16:31.050
Tea?

16:31.050 --> 16:33.680
<b>Water{top left}</b>

16:31.050 --> 16:33.680
<b>Tea{top right}</b>

16:31.050 --> 16:33.680
Please help yourselves{bottom left}

16:31.050 --> 16:33.680
Don't forget to stay hydrated!!{bottom right}

16:32.380 --> 16:33.310
Tea...

16:34.560 --> 16:37.040
M-My tummy hurts...

16:38.010 --> 16:40.500
<i>The batons are being handed off
to the fourth runners!</i>

16:41.140 --> 16:44.510
<i>The batons have been passed! 
The blue team is in the lead!</i>

16:44.510 --> 16:46.280
Hey, Kitagawa!

16:49.450 --> 16:52.550
<i>If that's how it is,
I'll need to pull ahead for us.</i>

16:53.380 --> 16:54.190
<i>But...</i>

16:55.800 --> 16:58.370
<i>We're in dead last!</i>

17:01.740 --> 17:04.240
<i>Ah, dang it!</i>

17:04.240 --> 17:08.480
<i>The baton has reached the fifth runner 
for the red team, Kasahara-san of class 5-1!</i>

17:08.480 --> 17:10.090
<i>She's desperately trying to catch up!</i>

17:10.400 --> 17:12.420
Oh, this is it.

17:12.420 --> 17:14.260
She'll never close that gap.

17:14.760 --> 17:16.990
<i>It all started with Takada-kun...</i>

17:16.990 --> 17:20.760
<i>But really, I've kind of felt
this way every year.</i>

17:21.320 --> 17:23.010
Y-You can do it!

17:23.830 --> 17:26.670
You can do it, Kasahara-san!

17:27.170 --> 17:29.340
Go, Kasahara!

17:29.340 --> 17:30.610
Do your best!

17:30.610 --> 17:32.990
Kasahara the Swift!

17:33.350 --> 17:36.330
<i>I've always wanted to yell like this!</i>

17:37.460 --> 17:40.330
Go, red team!

17:41.070 --> 17:42.380
<i>Wow, incredible!</i>

17:43.270 --> 17:47.550
<i>The red team just rushed past three runners!</i>

17:47.550 --> 17:49.200
Whoa!

17:49.200 --> 17:50.310
She's in second place!

17:50.530 --> 17:51.930
Just one more to go!

17:51.210 --> 17:52.600
She can do it! She can do it!

17:52.110 --> 17:53.540
Go for it!

17:53.540 --> 17:55.290
<i>Aw yeah!</i>

17:55.290 --> 17:58.360
<i>The blue team is coming up on an early 
baton pass to their anchor!</i>

17:58.360 --> 17:59.810
<i>What an astounding lead!</i>

17:59.810 --> 18:01.870
Shoot, the blue team's fast!

18:01.870 --> 18:03.570
Is Kitagawa good to run?

18:05.720 --> 18:07.430
L-Look over there!

18:07.430 --> 18:08.440
Ah!

18:10.280 --> 18:10.910
Ta...

18:13.810 --> 18:15.090
Kasahara-san!

18:15.090 --> 18:16.360
Leave the rest to me!

18:19.330 --> 18:21.820
<i>The red team is handing off!</i>

18:21.820 --> 18:25.120
<i>It's the transfer student from class 
5-1 everyone's talking about,</i>

18:25.120 --> 18:27.700
<i>Takada Taiyou-kun!</i>

18:27.700 --> 18:29.350
He made it!

18:31.170 --> 18:32.710
Get them!

18:32.170 --> 18:33.210
You're doing great!

18:38.760 --> 18:40.040
So fast!

18:39.550 --> 18:40.460
What speed!

18:40.460 --> 18:44.620
<i>He's steadily closing in on a sixth grader!</i>

18:52.850 --> 18:56.590
Go, Takada-kun!

18:59.130 --> 19:03.930
<i>That's the finish line!
The red team takes the win!</i>

19:06.830 --> 19:08.740
We did it!

19:08.740 --> 19:11.520
You were awesome! You're so fast!

19:13.170 --> 19:14.920
That was amazing!

19:14.920 --> 19:16.290
Not bad!

19:20.000 --> 19:21.120
Grin!

19:21.550 --> 19:23.000
Oh, shut up.

19:23.000 --> 19:25.290
Man, he's lightning fast.

19:25.290 --> 19:26.020
Yeah, yeah!

19:26.020 --> 19:28.320
But he sure took his time getting here!

19:28.320 --> 19:29.530
That's right!

19:39.390 --> 19:41.520
Thanks for waiting, Nishimura-san!

19:41.910 --> 19:42.690
Yeah!

19:44.030 --> 19:46.810
<i>What an upset! The red team
 has taken first place!</i>

19:49.780 --> 19:52.310
<i>I tried real hard too, you know.</i>

19:56.820 --> 19:58.370
Kasahara-san!

19:58.370 --> 19:59.520
Thank you!

19:59.520 --> 20:01.550
Wh-What's gotten into you?!

20:01.750 --> 20:06.590
Thank you so much for 
running your heart out!

20:07.070 --> 20:09.560
I get it already! Just get off of me!

20:09.560 --> 20:10.990
You're too close for comfort!

20:11.810 --> 20:15.020
Besides, if you touch me, your curse...

20:17.930 --> 20:20.400
What's the matter, Kasahara-san?

20:21.400 --> 20:22.640
Nothing...

20:25.660 --> 20:27.410
Don't worry about it...

20:31.320 --> 20:34.300
I wanna thank you too, Kasahara-san!

20:35.760 --> 20:38.240
We won thanks to you!

20:40.520 --> 20:41.610
Takada-kun!

20:44.810 --> 20:53.180
<i>This concludes the 51st That-There 
Elementary School Autumn Field Day.</i>

20:56.840 --> 20:59.790
Hey, the Grim Reaper's picking out photos!

20:59.790 --> 21:01.210
She's gonna curse them!

21:01.190 --> 21:08.140
Field Day Photographs

21:01.210 --> 21:04.200
What?! Just from picking them out?!

21:04.200 --> 21:05.270
That's incredible!

21:05.270 --> 21:08.150
Can you curse photos of me too?!

21:08.150 --> 21:10.050
T-Takada!

21:10.050 --> 21:11.500
Nishimura-san.

21:11.500 --> 21:15.230
Help me sort out the photos 
everyone ordered as class rep.

21:15.580 --> 21:16.450
Sure.

21:17.310 --> 21:21.600
Big events like this always
end way too soon, huh?

21:21.600 --> 21:22.470
Yeah.

21:22.860 --> 21:25.840
Look, here's a photo of 
just me and Takada-kun.

21:25.840 --> 21:27.150
Isn't it great?

21:27.150 --> 21:30.180
Yeah! You two look really cool!

21:31.510 --> 21:34.210
That's not what I was getting at...

21:34.990 --> 21:38.620
<i>Field day was over before I knew it.</i>

21:38.990 --> 21:43.490
<i>Even so, I don't think I'll 
forget how I felt that day.</i>

21:44.430 --> 21:46.480
Nishimura-san! Kasahara-san!

21:46.480 --> 21:48.070
Takada-kun?

21:48.070 --> 21:49.760
Let's walk home together!

21:49.760 --> 21:50.630
Huh?!

21:50.630 --> 21:52.310
M-Me too?!

21:59.160 --> 22:03.380
<i>I'll never forget how I felt that day.</i>

23:34.930 --> 23:39.930
<b>Next time...</b>

23:34.930 --> 23:39.930
<b>My First Time Having Guests Over</b>
